WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:02.327
Connect Jev to the browser you choose.

00:00:02.487 --> 00:00:04.385
Cloud, local, or self-hosted.

00:00:07.300 --> 00:00:09.497
Read the DOM across the document.

00:00:09.657 --> 00:00:13.903
Find controls beyond the viewport, and retrieve text relevant to your goal.

00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:18.668
Jev chooses an operation and a target.

00:00:18.828 --> 00:00:22.604
Actions run on the selected element, without screen coordinates.

00:00:22.764 --> 00:00:24.727
Even when the browser skips rendering.

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:28.900
Keep the same agent code.

00:00:29.060 --> 00:00:31.748
Change the CDP endpoint to switch browsers.

00:00:35.300 --> 00:00:44.324
The repository reports tests across fourteen browser configurations, spanning cloud services, local engines, and self-hosted stacks.

00:00:45.300 --> 00:00:46.473
Choose your browser.

00:00:46.633 --> 00:00:47.572
Set your goal.

00:00:47.732 --> 00:00:48.628
Run Jev.

00:00:48.788 --> 00:00:50.196
Get started on GitHub.
